# Stage 3 passive observer load: four native combatants, no policy/body ownership.
# bodyobserve creates two isolated human pairs with one million HP and keeps
# native combat AI active for ten simulated minutes. The extra HP is confined
# to these bench-owned actors and is not the production combat contract.
set time 12 0
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
turn 210
wait 500
watch player
clear 3000
immortal player on
release all
bodyobserve 17 600000
# One extra 100 ms sampling fence covers the initial 30 Hz sample quantization.
wait 600100
